  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria, regiona crisis 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syrien, regional kris 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;det ges till den regionala syriska krisen icke &#xF6;r&#xF6;nm&#xE4;rkt bl.a. mot underlag f&#xF6;r Regional Response Plan Syria March 2012. Med speciellt   syfte att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra den humanit&#xE4;ra st&#xF6;det till barn. F&#xF6;rutom FN ges   &#xE4;ven st&#xF6;d till R&#xE4;dda Barnen och Islamic Relief som verkar i           n&#xE4;rliggande l&#xE4;nder med flyktingar fr&#xE5;n Syrien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support is provided to the regional crisis of Syria non-earmarked as  to the country of intervention partly based on the Regional Response  Plan for Syria March 2012. Special attention is given to the          situation of children. In addition to the UN agencies support is      given to Save the Children Sweden and Islamic Relief whom work in the nearby lying countries with refugees from Syria.</narrative>
  </description>
